---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import founderBg from "../assets/founder-bg.jpg";
import jocelyn from "../assets/jocelyn-stoddard.jpg";
---

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-brand-dark-green relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background photo + dark overlay -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none">
    <Image
      src={founderBg}
      alt=""
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      widths={[768, 1280, 1920]}
      sizes="100vw"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:rgba(57,86,89,0.92)"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="absolute -bottom-32 -right-24 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-orange/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <figure class="relative max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <blockquote>
      <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold italic text-white leading-snug">
        &ldquo;Built by a Utah real estate agent who got tired of losing clients
        to Zillow.&rdquo;
      </p>
    </blockquote>

    <!-- Attribution -->
    <figcaption class="mt-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <Image
        src={jocelyn}
        alt="Jocelyn Stoddard, founder of Brick & Yield"
        width={128}
        height={128}
        class="h-16 w-16 rounded-full object-cover object-top ring-2 ring-brand-orange/60"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <div class="text-left">
        <div class="text-white font-bold">Jocelyn Stoddard</div>
        <div class="text-brand-light-green text-sm">
          Founder of Brick &amp; Yield &middot; Utah agent &amp; investor
        </div>
      </div>
    </figcaption>

    <!-- Bio -->
    <div class="mt-8 text-brand-light-green leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto space-y-4">
      <p>
        Jocelyn built Brick &amp; Yield because she needed it for her own
        business first. After watching too many clients drift to the big
        portals, she designed a platform that keeps agents at the center of
        every relationship.
      </p>
      <p>
        Now she’s licensing it to other agents and brokers who want the same
        edge.
      </p>
    </div>
  </figure>
</section>
